{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_047A50","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"其实，我也见过宇宙猫。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"宇宙……猫？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"嗯。当时天很黑，我没看清，不过那是一只尾巴特别长的猫。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"而且，它的眼睛在黑暗里闪闪发光。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"猫的眼睛本来就会发光吧……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我一开始也以为只是普通的猫。可那家伙直接在我脑子里跟我说话了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"……在脑子里？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"它自称Altargozo Elbakki Munyudar。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":38,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"它说自己来自仙女座星系，是来调查地球核武器的……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"仙女座星系……。人类才勉强登上月球，根本不可能把核武器打到那么远的地方。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"Elbakki正在守望人类，防止我们用核武器自我毁灭。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"直到有一天，人类成为宇宙联邦的一员……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"……这话听着可真刺耳。嘴上说着什么<R=紧张缓和,DÉTENTE>，却还是发生了这次这样的事。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=紧张缓和,DÉTENTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":118,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"要是哪次出了差错，引发了报复的连锁反应……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"嗯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"这个星球随时都可能因为核战争而自我毁灭……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""}]}